```console
$ scherzo-cloud organization deletion cancel --help
Cancel organization deletion

Usage: scherzo-cloud organization deletion cancel [OPTIONS] <ORGANIZATION>

Arguments:
  <ORGANIZATION>  Organization ID or exact slug

Options:
      --json                 Emit newline-delimited JSON events
      --allow-insecure-http  Allow this command's Scherzo Cloud requests over insecure HTTP connections
  -h, --help                 Print help

Authorization:
  Cancellation requires a current active human owner using the same linked identity that requested deletion.

Proof:
  This command starts a fresh browser sign-in. The proof is not stored as a local session.

```
